{"id":72116,"date":"2026-10-31T21:50:17","date_gmt":"2026-10-31T21:50:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72116"},"modified":"2026-10-31T22:51:53","modified_gmt":"2026-10-31T21:51:53","slug":"grande-premio-peniche-a-correr","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grande-premio-peniche-a-correr\/","title":{"rendered":"Peniche a Correr 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Peniche a Correr 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Peniche a Correr 2027<\/strong> (VIII Grande Pr\u00e9mio Peniche a Correr) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>10 de Janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, na cidade costeira de <strong>Peniche<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. Com partida e chegada instaladas junto ao <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Peniche<\/strong> (Avenida do Porto de Pesca), esta 8\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o alia a competi\u00e7\u00e3o de estrada a uma forte vertente solid\u00e1ria: <strong>60% do valor de cada inscri\u00e7\u00e3o reverte diretamente a favor da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Humanit\u00e1ria dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Peniche<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O evento arranca \u00e0s <strong>09:45<\/strong> com a <strong>Kids Race (500 m)<\/strong> para crian\u00e7as nascidas ap\u00f3s 2016, seguindo-se a partida da prova principal de <strong>Corrida 10K (10.000 m)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10:30<\/strong> e da <strong>Caminhada 5K (5.000 m)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10:40<\/strong>. O tra\u00e7ado oficial dos 10 km percorre o centro hist\u00f3rico e a frente atl\u00e2ntica da pen\u00ednsula de Peniche \u2014 passando pela Pra\u00e7a Jacob Rodrigues Pereira, Avenida 25 de Abril, Estrada dos Rem\u00e9dios, <strong>Estrada Marginal Norte<\/strong>, <strong>Rua do Farol<\/strong> (Cabo Carvoeiro), <strong>Estrada Marginal Sudoeste<\/strong>, Campo da Rep\u00fablica e Avenida do Mar at\u00e9 regressar ao Quartel dos Bombeiros \u2014 com posto de abastecimento ao <strong>Km 5<\/strong> e na meta.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Promovido conjuntamente pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Peniche a Correr<\/strong> e pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Humanit\u00e1ria dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Peniche<\/strong>, o evento atribui pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos 3 primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina, trof\u00e9us por escal\u00e3o (de Juniores a Veteranos 75), pr\u00e9mios para Equipa Mais Numerosa e Equipa Desempenho, garantindo t-shirt oficial, bengaleiro e <strong>medalha finisher<\/strong> a todos os participantes. Descobre mais provas no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de 10 km<\/a> e calcula o teu ritmo na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios (Av. do Porto de Pesca), Peniche, Leiria<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\