fy-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 5K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 10 de Janeiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:40<\/span><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83d\udca7 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Abastecimentos:<\/strong> \u00c1gua e fruta na meta + medalha finisher (Op\u00e7\u00e3o de almo\u00e7o sopa\/bifana\/bebida: +4,00 \u20ac)<\/div><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 6,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 01\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 8,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (02\/11 a 20\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 9,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (21\/12 a 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Kids Race (Nascidos ap\u00f3s 2016)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 10 de Janeiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:45<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 5,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 01\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 6,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (02\/11 a 20\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 7,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (21\/12 a 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Peniche a Correr 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O VIII Grande Pr\u00e9mio Peniche a Correr realiza-se no domingo, 10 de Janeiro de 2027, com partida e chegada no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Peniche (Avenida do Porto de Pesca), em Peniche (distrito de Leiria). A Kids Race (500 m) parte \u00e0s 09:45, a Corrida 10K \u00e0s 10:30 e a Caminhada 5K \u00e0s 10:40.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Peniche a Correr 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o divididas em 3 fases: 1\u00aa Fase (at\u00e9 1 de novembro de 2026) \u2014 12,00 \u20ac nos 10K, 6,00 \u20ac na Caminhada 5K e 5,00 \u20ac na Kids Race; 2\u00aa Fase (2 de novembro a 20 de dezembro de 2026) \u2014 14,00 \u20ac nos 10K, 8,00 \u20ac na Caminhada e 6,00 \u20ac na Kids Race; 3\u00aa Fase (21 a 31 de dezembro de 2026) \u2014 15,00 \u20ac nos 10K, 9,00 \u20ac na Caminhada e 7,00 \u20ac na Kids Race. Existe ainda op\u00e7\u00e3o de almo\u00e7o (sopa, bifana e bebida) por 4,00 \u20ac. 60% do valor de cada inscri\u00e7\u00e3o reverte a favor dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Peniche.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o hor\u00e1rio do secretariado e do bengaleiro?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento do kit do participante decorre no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Peniche no s\u00e1bado, 9 de janeiro de 2027, das 14:30 \u00e0s 19:30, e no domingo, 10 de janeiro de 2027, das 08:00 \u00e0s 09:15. O servi\u00e7o de bengaleiro funciona no mesmo pavilh\u00e3o e encerra 45 minutos antes da partida.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como \u00e9 o percurso dos 10 km e onde est\u00e3o os abastecimentos?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso de 10.000 metros parte do Quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Peniche e passa pela Pra\u00e7a Jacob Rodrigues Pereira, Av. 25 de Abril, Av. Mariano Calado, Rua Gen. Humberto Delgado, Av. Arquiteto Paulino Montez, Rua da Cruz das Almas, Estrada dos Rem\u00e9dios, Estrada Marginal Norte, Rua do Farol, Estrada Marginal Sudoeste, Rua de S\u00e3o Marcos, Campo da Rep\u00fablica, Av. do Mar e Rua 13 de Infantaria at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta no Quartel dos Bombeiros. Existe abastecimento l\u00edquido ao Km 5 e \u00e1gua e fruta na meta.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e que pr\u00e9mios s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui t-shirt oficial da prova, dorsal (com chip nos 10K), seguro desportivo, abastecimento final e medalha finisher para todos os participantes (10K, Caminhada 5K e Kids Race). Na Corrida 10K h\u00e1 pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para os 3 primeiros da geral (M\/F), trof\u00e9us para o Top 3 de cada escal\u00e3o (Juniores a Veteranos 75), pr\u00e9mio para a Equipa Mais Numerosa e para a Equipa Desempenho (M\/F).<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Peniche a Correr 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-10\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-10\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios (Av. do Porto de Pesca)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Peniche\", \"addressRegion\": \"Leiria\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O VIII Grande Pr\u00e9mio Peniche a Correr 2027 realiza-se a 10 de janeiro em Peniche. Corrida de 10 km, caminhada 5 km e Kids Race. Garante o teu dorsal oficial!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-grande-premio-peniche-a-correr.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida 10K \u2014 VIII Grande Pr\u00e9mio Peniche a Correr\", \"price\": \"12.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/waitastart.com\/gp-penicheacorrer-2027\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada 5K\", \"price\": \"6.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/waitastart.com\/gp-penicheacorrer-2027\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"